OL,3,GNEWSARail services cancelled due to
OL,4,Asignalling fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers are being warned of
OL,7,Fmajor disruption after a signalling
OL,8,Ffault forced the closure of lines in
OL,9,Fand out of Birmingham Moor Street with
OL,10,Fthe cancellations likely to last for
OL,11,Fmuch of the day.
OL,13,FThe fault has shut all lines between
OL,14,Fthe station and Small Heath, with
OL,15,Fservices unable to operate between Moor
OL,16,FStreet and Leamington Spa and
OL,17,FStratford-upon-Avon.
OL,19,FAs a result, trains, including services
OL,20,Fto London Marylebone, are either being
OL,21,Fcancelled entirely or running on
OL,22,Fshortened routes.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
