OL,3,GNEWSARail services cancelled due to
OL,4,Asignalling fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the second time in less than a
OL,7,Fweek that services have been disrupted.
OL,8,FNo services were able to pass through
OL,9,Fthe station on Thursday morning due to
OL,10,Fa fault with the station's signalling
OL,11,Fsystem.
